                        "rating":  1,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This is fake Italian. I came with my family for the brunch buffet and they had a make your own pasta bar, which was nice.\nGood ice cream and Greek yogurt.\n\nBut if you care about the main courses, nothing is Italian. The pizza they provide was very weak. Pepperoni and pineapple, mushroom. Not what you’d expect from an Italian buffet - especially not pineapple!!! That is a sin on pizza itself.\n\nI’m never coming back and I wish I never came.\n\nNow this is the brunch buffet, but they should be more considerate. The meat selection was of low quality and the cheese platter they have is a joke. These are cornerstones to any place that calls itself Italian.\n\nI wish I just went to Costco and bought Italian food to make at home. It would be much better than this place.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
